  "name": "Waves of Exhaustion",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A nimbus of gray light surrounds you while you concentrate (up to 1 minute). As a Magic action, emit a 60-ft Cone (Wave of Gray Light activity): each creature in it makes a CON save or gains 1 Exhaustion level. This can't raise a creature above Exhaustion 4, and the levels it gave are removed when the spell ends.</p>",
